</div>
<div class="visbox">
<div class="metric"><span class="lab">目标覆盖率</span><div class="meter green"><span id="appendix-d006-the-incoming-wave-revised-confTargetBar"></span></div><span id="appendix-d006-the-incoming-wave-revised-confTargetPct">90%</span></div>
